    "summary": "While the only units of yours that an enemy unit is in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of are **FORTIFICATIONS**:\n\n- it can still be picked as a target for ranged attacks, but each such attack not made with a **[[PISTOL]](vsdata:weapon-ability/pistol)** gets -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)\n- while [Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), models in that unit need not take [Desperate Escape tests](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape) when they **[Fall Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)**, unless they would cross enemy models in that move",
